# Nothing this tool produces belongs in the repo.
#
# Profiles, cooldown state and the watcher log all live under
# %USERPROFILE%\.claude-profiles\ and never appear here. Saved profiles contain
# real session credentials and are DPAPI-encrypted to a single Windows user, so
# they are neither shareable nor useful to anyone else -- do not add them.

# Local shortcuts and scratch
*.lnk
*.log
*.tmp

# If anyone ever copies profile state next to the scripts by mistake
.claude-profiles/
*cooldowns.json
autoswitch.log

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
